  "date": "2026-08-29T22:12:47Z",
  "subject": "gitops: fix external-secrets argocd repo creds template, document bootstrap",
  "body": "The argocd-repo-creds template indexed .Values.argocdRepoToken.enabled\nwithout a default, nil-pointing on prod/test where argocdRepoToken is\nundefined and blocking hydration. Guard with dig + default (dict).\n\nmgmt feeds the git write token directly as a repository-write secret now,\nso disable the Bitwarden-materialized argocd repo secret on mgmt.\n\nAdd bootstrap.md: tofu destroy -> apply routine (mgmt-only manual steps\n+ app-of-apps takes over).\n"
}
